    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s1_side02_0060_camera_02",
      "hash64": "443525A6423B38E7",
      "text": "赫月的照片\\n已經順利洗出來了！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s1_side02_0060_select_01",
      "hash64": "75749C56FDB0EFAB",
      "text": "我想看！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s1_side02_0060_select_02",
      "hash64": "75749D56FDB0F15E",
      "text": "拍得怎麼樣？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s1_side02_0060_camera_03",
      "hash64": "443524A6423B3734",
      "text": "哎呀～實際看到照片才發現，\\n赫月整個拍得糊糊的，\\r\\n身體也沒拍完整，\\r\\n焦距也沒對好。[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s1_side02_0060_camera_04",
      "hash64": "443523A6423B3581",
      "text": "拍成這樣實在沒辦法\\n拿給助手[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳看啊。[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s1_side02_0060_camera_05",
      "hash64": "443522A6423B33CE",
      "text": "……可是。\\c\\n在至今拍過的照片中，\\n這成為我最喜歡的照片了。[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s1_side02_0060_camera_06",
      "hash64": "443521A6423B321B",
      "text": "也許我一直以來都想太多了吧。\\n拍照技法之類的……\\r\\n符不符合評審的喜好之類的……\\r\\n自己到底想拍什麼之類的……[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s1_side02_0060_camera_07",
      "hash64": "443520A6423B3068",
      "text": "明明只要憑著一股熱情去忘我地拍攝，\\n拍出來的東西就是照片了說！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s1_side02_0060_camera_08",
      "hash64": "44351FA6423B2EB5",
      "text": "助手啊，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳教會了我重要的事情。\\r\\n……謝謝[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳喔。[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
