        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s1_side02_0060_camera_09",
      "hash64": "44351EA6423B2D02",
      "text": "啊！這麼說來，\\n我一直沒問助手[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的名字！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s1_side02_0060_camera_10",
      "hash64": "4431A1A6423822C4",
      "text": "真對不起呀～雖然遲了些，\\n能不能告訴我[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的名字呢？[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
