    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s1_side02_0060_camera_12",
      "hash64": "4431A3A64238262A",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]！\\n哎呀？怎麼啦？\\r\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳突然害羞起來了嗎？[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
